chx:X_ScriptLimits a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:ScriptLimits ; rdfs:label "10,000 bytes, 201 operations, 520-byte items, 1,000 stack items"@en ; skos:definition "Bitcoin Core bounds a script by its size, its number of non-push operations, the size of any item it pushes, the depth of its stack and the number of keys one multisignature operator accepts."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0401/ch07/research> .
